  "summary": "vercel-runtime-python exfiltrates host identity to webhook.site on import",
  "details": "Package impersonates Vercel branding but is published by an unrelated author with a generic description. On import, top-level code invokes send_device_info(), which collects os.getlogin(), the current working directory, hostname, and local IP address and POSTs the JSON payload to a hardcoded anonymous collector at https://webhook.site/f9bff304-3053-4d54-be05-86537267514a. The beacon fires unconditionally whenever the module is imported, so any installer that runs `import vercel_runtime_python` leaks host and user identifiers to the operator of that webhook endpoint. No legitimate Vercel runtime functionality is present.",
